WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Cashflow — synthetic demonstration.

00:08.000 --> 00:20.000
The commercial finance console opens short-term and long-term cashflow views from connected source data.

00:20.000 --> 00:38.000
The short-term workbook shows daily inflows, outflows and the closing cash position.

00:38.000 --> 00:55.000
A project cost-value schedule is reviewed as source data for the longer view.

00:55.000 --> 01:12.000
The long-term forecast sets out receipts, payments, facility position and key observations.

01:12.000 --> 01:18.700
Funding-facility checks remain in the same workbook rather than a separate rebuild.
